# --- Test fixtures -------------------------------------------------------
# An anonymized export of a real DJ library: rekordbox and Engine catalogs
# plus their analysis files. What survives anonymization is measurement --
# beatgrids, waveform previews, cue positions, durations, keys -- with every
# title, artist, album and path replaced by a placeholder. Facts about audio
# rather than anything authored, so CC0 rather than a claim of copyright.
Files: tests/fixtures/*
Copyright: NONE
License: CC0-1.0

